<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#preparationInstructions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Complete instructions for assembling the PlantPreparation: order of addition, timing, incantations, quantities, and critical steps. Governed at initiated-only minimum; elder-initiated for consecrated preparations such as Omiero."@en .
